  m_text: "\tIf you find it difficult to understand whether you can defeat an enemy
    of the same level <s>(because if the level is the same but the size is different,
    the larger one wins)</s>, use the Enemy Detector hint in the form of an arrow.
    If you see it, run away as fast as you can in the opposite direction."
