  m_text: "\tFor each level of your fish, there will be corresponding enemies on
    the map, including weaker levels, your level, and stronger levels. <s>However,
    please note that if you die and your level drops, existing predators, even if
    they are of higher levels, will not disappear until someone eats them. Therefore,
    for your safety, avoid dying."
