  m_text: "\tBe careful when entering shark mode, as all sharks can attack their
    own kind, even those of the same level. So if you delay eating for too long,
    somewhere in the depths of the sea, a <color=red>monster</color=red> will be
    waiting for you, having eaten all its friends and become indestructible."
